1
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:07,800
Every run of Director's Cut
starts in camp.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,800
Upgrade a building.
The camp grows stronger every run.

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,800
Slot a film card:
harder run, bigger payout.

4
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:19,500
Then you're dropped
into the horde.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:26,800
Every level-up is an editing decision:
take one upgrade — or cut one first.

6
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:33,000
What you cut leaves your pool for good —
and becomes the boss's weapon.

7
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:38,800
Three copies make a star.
Two stars hit harder.

8
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Loot raises your heat.
Higher heat, stronger enemies.

9
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:48,800
Reach extraction alive,
and you keep it all.

10
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Director's Cut.
Solo, in four days.
